      "id": 264104,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:34:11.734Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Beat, the hip jive turkey who’s the funky fresh realness from the streets!</p>\n<p>Samba the spicy Latina.</p>\n<p>Pluck, who can go ***ck himself.</p>\n<p>I don’t even know how to spell the last one.</p>\n<p>This story being intentionally bad saddens me, because the story of the Virtuosos fighting AB over the centuries has a lot of the same vibe as the Legacy line, but global and millenia of lost history instead of an American family tree.  The four could have grown to become a new window into the past history of these warriors; with AB gone, the Void has a power vacuum and might be a much greater threat.</p>\n<p>Extrasode 8: Christopher and Adam Give Fake Pet Care Advice.</p>\n<p>Haka isn’t undead, he’s re-alive.  And AA was never dead, he was simply de-existified.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:40:19.804Z",
